# `npm run build:instrumented` — a real optimised production build that still
# carries the instruments. This is the one to use when taking a measurement
# that must not be distorted by having DevTools attached (V8 drops WASM to a
# debuggable tier while an inspector is open: 2.75x slower on this build).
#
# A plain `npm run build`, and therefore `npm run tauri build`, leaves them out.
VITE_WRUSTTY_INSTRUMENTS=1
